{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o051b","title":"钟繇言荀攸十二奇策撰集未就","accounts":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o051b-account","label":"《荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十》正文","text":"钟繇言荀攸十二奇策撰集未就","evidence":["xunyu-e-o051b-q"]},{"id":"xunyu-a-p042-judgment","label":"裴松之按","text":"裴松之认为荀攸卒后十六年钟繇才卒，惋惜终未编成奇策。","evidence":["xunyu-q-p042-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0181","role":"撰集","evidence":["xunyu-e-o051b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"曹丕为世子及荀攸病时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xunyu-e-o051b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-o051b-q","source_order":[10,243,"O051b"],"order":2500}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0181","name":"钟繇","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o051b-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-fc049cc7116f5d876adb","layer":"original","quote":"攸与钟繇善，繇言：“我每有所行〖10〗，反复思惟，自谓无以易〖11〗；以咨公达，辄复过人意〖12〗。公达前后凡画奇策十二，唯繇知之。”繇撰集未就，会薨，故世不得尽闻也。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":242,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":57,"end":141,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-p042-judgment","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-a06421462b9a0640a6e1","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞臣松之按：攸亡后十六年，钟繇乃卒。撰攸奇策，亦有何难？而年造八十，犹云“未就”。遂使攸从征机策之谋，不传于世。惜哉！","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":261,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9346ca433d0d7cce2324","start":0,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
